{"id":"5fc33cbab29395e4","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency.md","title":"标准 KF 证明 PA 一致性的直接推论","display":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 标准 KF 证明 PA 一致性的直接推论","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency","aliases":["91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency","91-cor-ind-consistency","91-cor-provability-needs-induction"],"display":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 标准 KF 证明 PA 一致性的直接推论","depends_on":["[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency</span><span>91-cor-ind-consistency</span><span>91-cor-provability-needs-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-induction-necessity-consistency — 标准 KF 证明 PA 一致性的直接推论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 为原书完整归纳版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 采用通常有限证明编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 是其一致性句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是上游实际定理的推论，不再把 KF 可证全局反射与矛盾不真写成尚待满足的条件。含 T 的证明长度归纳是该证明的一种机制；标题“necessity”不表示所有证明都必须使用真理归纳。\n标准强度证明也可通过 KF 的分层真理解释得到此后果。不能由这一个证明推得所有弱 KF 或所有归纳子模式也证明一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.3；上游 KF 一致性证明定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}induction\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true}],"bytes":1286,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-induction-necessity-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["a295446296ee06c0"]}